>
>## Given an adjacency function and a distinguished root node, find all reachable nodes (including the root node)
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term findReachableNodes = λadj,root.let visit := λvisited,node.let toVisit := sets.difference (adj node) visited in logic.ifElse (sets.isEmpty toVisit) visited (lists.foldl (λv,n.visit (sets.insert n v) n) visited (sets.toList toVisit)) in visit (sets.singleton root) root
