>## Initial state for Tarjan's algorithm
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term initialState = topology.TarjanState{counter = 0:int32, indices = maps.empty, lowLinks = maps.empty, stack = [], onStack = sets.empty, sccs = []}
