>
>## Compute the strongly connected components of the given graph. The components are returned in reverse topological order
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term stronglyConnectedComponents = λgraph.let verts := maps.keys graph in let finalState := lists.foldl (λst,v.logic.ifElse (maps.member v (topology.TarjanState[indices] st)) st (strongConnect graph v st)) initialState verts in lists.reverse (lists.map lists.sort (topology.TarjanState[sccs] finalState))
