>## Sort a directed acyclic graph (DAG) based on an adjacency list. Yields a list of nontrivial strongly connected components if the graph has cycles, otherwise a simple list.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term topologicalSort = λpairs.let sccs := topologicalSortComponents pairs in let isCycle := λscc.ordering.gt (lists.length scc) 1:int32 in let withCycles := lists.filter isCycle sccs in logic.ifElse (lists.isEmpty withCycles) right(lists.concat sccs) left(withCycles)
