>## Find the strongly connected components (including cycles and isolated vertices) of a graph, in (reverse) topological order, i.e. dependencies before dependents
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term topologicalSortComponents = λpairs.let graphResult := adjacencyListsToGraph pairs in let g := pairs.first graphResult in lists.map (λcomp.optionals.mapOptional (pairs.second graphResult) comp) (stronglyConnectedComponents g)
